                "word": "temerarious",
                "pos": "adj",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "527528ea-a8df-40e3-8657-3cc88f0f3d14",
                        "entry_id": "a19b02e6-73ad-399a-be21-5b0b3bc85cd2",
                        "tags": [
                            "comparative"
                        ],
                        "form": "more temerarious"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "8072bb99-c51b-4d7a-9922-05a4d22aa54e",
                        "entry_id": "a19b02e6-73ad-399a-be21-5b0b3bc85cd2",
                        "tags": [
                            "superlative"
                        ],
                        "form": "most temerarious"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "424d688d-a1ba-3cb0-ad91-f7e594a3a77d",
                        "entry_id": "a19b02e6-73ad-399a-be21-5b0b3bc85cd2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Characterized by temerity; recklessly daring or bold."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "792bd780-de4f-4437-bc39-1f1cd1562364",
                                "sense_id": "424d688d-a1ba-3cb0-ad91-f7e594a3a77d",
                                "text": "[…] he furthwith by thinſtinct of yͤ ſpirite of god, in repꝛoche of all ſuch temerarious bold & blind iudgement, geuē vpon a mā whoſe inward mind and ſodain change they cannot ſee, ſhoꝛtly proued thē al deceiued, […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "203b9c80-30b5-4dda-b4e1-362cf68d334e",
                                "sense_id": "424d688d-a1ba-3cb0-ad91-f7e594a3a77d",
                                "text": "To look back upon the past year, and see how little we have striven and to what small purpose; and how often we have been cowardly and hung back, or temerarious and rushed unwisely in; and how every day and all day long we have transgressed the law of kindness;—it may seem a paradox, but in the bitterness of these discoveries, a certain consolation resides."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "24ca6980-8f19-4ee3-9047-32aeb3298205",
                                "sense_id": "424d688d-a1ba-3cb0-ad91-f7e594a3a77d",
                                "text": "It was a very bright, hot winter's day, and try as I might, I could not bring myself to think of any danger. I believe that in this way most temerarious deeds are done; the doer has become insensible to danger, and his imagination is clouded with some engrossing purpose."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "49b45e86-3534-4dbb-a626-1dcda595465b",
                                "sense_id": "424d688d-a1ba-3cb0-ad91-f7e594a3a77d",
                                "text": "With a vicious lunge the elephant swerved to the right to dispose of this temerarious foeman who dared intervene between himself and his intended victim; but he had not reckoned on the lightning quickness that could galvanize those steel muscles into action so marvelously swift as to baffle even a keener eyesight than Tantor’s."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c369ae6-3366-4688-b4c2-1ddcf3ea144d",
                                "sense_id": "424d688d-a1ba-3cb0-ad91-f7e594a3a77d",
                                "text": "Primarily and supremely man is always the pioneer of life, adventuring onward into the unknown, alone with his own temerarious, dauntless soul."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "501abcb5-7bb4-4a25-93f3-c5b62fea5b4f",
                        "source_entry_id": "a19b02e6-73ad-399a-be21-5b0b3bc85cd2",
                        "source_sense_id": "424d688d-a1ba-3cb0-ad91-f7e594a3a77d",
                        "source_sense_description": "recklessly bold",
                        "target_lang_word": "téméraire",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "téméraire",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "25337867-7fe6-3a36-970f-9dce27c5f13e",
                                        "entry_id": "7e1f79b2-b370-3287-a0db-ab84a6e4048b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui est d’une hardiesse imprudente ou inconsidérée ; qui est hasardeux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "note": "Il se dit des personnes et des choses",
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "816879f7-84de-4cf5-b560-392e0515d3c4",
                                                "sense_id": "25337867-7fe6-3a36-970f-9dce27c5f13e",
                                                "text": "Aucun dealeur local ne peut satisfaire la totalité de la nouvelle demande de cannabis et les jeunes les plus téméraires s’aventurent dans les cités des environs pour s'approvisionner, puis consomment et revendent dans les rues de leur quartier."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9aeedadb-5eaa-4d5a-bc38-b94a9ef474c1",
                                                "sense_id": "25337867-7fe6-3a36-970f-9dce27c5f13e",
                                                "text": "Comme les acrobates, je préfère travailler sans filet, et privilégier la beauté téméraire du geste à une pâle exécution."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebc92921-591f-4cad-9c0c-23ca0545b55c",
                                                "sense_id": "25337867-7fe6-3a36-970f-9dce27c5f13e",
                                                "text": "Il est plus téméraire que brave."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "15274014-5e96-4762-98ba-778538c0674c",
                                                "sense_id": "25337867-7fe6-3a36-970f-9dce27c5f13e",
                                                "text": "Il faut être bien téméraire pour avancer ce que vous dites."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47ac98b7-fe1f-4008-a826-724f7d27b053",
                                                "sense_id": "25337867-7fe6-3a36-970f-9dce27c5f13e",
                                                "text": "Une généralisation téméraire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "efe8a761-b7ec-4623-8612-98b82b7e61e4",
                                                "sense_id": "25337867-7fe6-3a36-970f-9dce27c5f13e",
                                                "text": "Proposition téméraire, Proposition trop hardie, de laquelle on peut tirer des inductions contraires à la véritable doctrine."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7b69bacf-8f66-4091-b207-2f325a048cf2",
                                                "sense_id": "25337867-7fe6-3a36-970f-9dce27c5f13e",
                                                "text": "Ce prédicateur avança une proposition téméraire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47d97cf7-516b-470e-b745-163686622b9b",
                                                "sense_id": "25337867-7fe6-3a36-970f-9dce27c5f13e",
                                                "text": "Sa proposition fut condamnée comme téméraire."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f5d5aa95-ecef-4879-a733-a131c4283bd9",
                                                "sense_id": "25337867-7fe6-3a36-970f-9dce27c5f13e",
                                                "text": "Jugement téméraire, Jugement qu’on fait en mauvaise part d’une personne ou d’une action, sans être fondé sur des preuves suffisantes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8eb85793-3248-45cb-b255-2fd2af1d6e4f",
                                                "sense_id": "25337867-7fe6-3a36-970f-9dce27c5f13e",
                                                "text": "Vous faites un jugement téméraire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "téméraire",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "312b8e8e-5364-3243-8dc0-5e8a83a2b407",
                                        "entry_id": "de2e0e7d-a1c0-3aef-b13a-6c7d24a4c689",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Personne téméraire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
